{
  "app": "karak2",
  "onboarded": true,
  "auto": true,
  "repo": "/home/openclaw/Dev/karak2",
  "branch": "main",
  "releaseRoot": "/opt/developed-apps/karak2/releases",
  "runtimeUser": "developed-karak2",
  "archivePaths": ["backend", "frontend", "gateway", "packages", "deploy", "package.json", "pnpm-lock.yaml", "pnpm-workspace.yaml", "turbo.json", "tsconfig.base.json"],
  "migrationPaths": ["backend/db"],
  "notes": [
    "One service (deploy/run.mjs starts Nest backend, Next frontend and the identity gateway); a release switch restarts it, which signs everyone out locally and drops in-memory games.",
    "backend/db SQL has no ledger: any change there blocks until applied by hand (deploy/README.md order), then --migrations-applied.",
    "Production deps only: a full install builds and tests, then 'pnpm install --prod --offline' relinks the workspace (pnpm prune --prod breaks workspace links). frontend's sharp is build-only.",
    "Frontend build cache (.next/cache) is dropped from releases."
  ],
  "sides": {
    "app": {
      "paths": ["backend", "frontend", "gateway", "packages", "deploy/run.mjs", "package.json", "pnpm-lock.yaml", "pnpm-workspace.yaml"],
      "env": { "CI": "true", "NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED": "1" },
      "steps": [
        "pnpm install --frozen-lockfile",
        "pnpm test",
        "pnpm build",
        "rm -rf frontend/.next/cache",
        "pnpm install --prod --frozen-lockfile --offline"
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        { "from": "backend", "to": "backend" },
        { "from": "frontend", "to": "frontend" },
        { "from": "gateway", "to": "gateway" },
        { "from": "packages", "to": "packages" },
        { "from": "deploy", "to": "deploy" },
        { "from": "node_modules", "to": "node_modules" },
        { "from": "package.json", "to": "package.json" },
        { "from": "pnpm-lock.yaml", "to": "pnpm-lock.yaml" },
        { "from": "pnpm-workspace.yaml", "to": "pnpm-workspace.yaml" }
      ],
      "verify": ["deploy/run.mjs", "backend/dist/main.js", "frontend/.next/BUILD_ID", "frontend/server.mjs", "gateway/server.mjs", "frontend/node_modules/next", "gateway/node_modules/@developed/ecosystem-auth"],
      "switch": { "type": "symlink-restart", "link": "/opt/developed-apps/karak2/current", "unit": "developed-karak2.service" },
      "health": [
        { "url": "https://karak2.developed.sk/health", "status": 200 },
        { "url": "https://karak2.developed.sk/api/heroes", "status": 401 },
        { "url": "https://karak2.developed.sk/", "status": 303 }
      ]
    }
  }
}
